{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Isolate all non-fatal scope errors.** An `AssertionError` or other non-fatal `Error` from an opener bypasses this catch and fails the invocation before the handler runs. The corresponding close catch also aborts remaining reverse-order cleanup. Catch `Throwable`, classify it through `reportHandlerScopeFailure`, and rethrow only unwrapped `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`; add open/close regression tests using `AssertionError`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75wxrc","finding_digest":"e8a66c03ea2a27a3faa0ca4b92e2a93ff8dddf8372b2886a14e1deb3ac8abe44","finding_id":"arf_v1_5ctgya7kfit2h6vazjfzfyvjh7","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::runhandler::nonfatal-error-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::runhandler::nonfatal-error-isolation","line":88,"observation_digest":"974c5f45e28975c5f16f118f328d65f2050fb05386b19826734b9f39176be5d1","observation_id":"aro_v1_s5gf6rpcrf24l4lpcghtfdlf6i","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:33:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_grmj63ih7rnh7kcttdvmaefrnm","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"aa073e4bfa1f0cdcc78d4719e3ed79ff3b4d38fd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":87,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_eg4es6itkkzvf3ve4taazl2eln","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:33:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
